00:00.000Z","overview":"While Pedro chases control, Pritam chases logic. With Vinny still missing, their efforts reveal an unsettling truth - the case is moving on someone else's terms.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5iNRoyuIo2dLerMeL3x35ggwUMf.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyNi9Qcml0YW0lMjBhbmQlMjBQZWRybyUyMCUyODIwMjYlMjkv.1.4","title":"The Blue Whale","season":1,"episode":4,"released":"2026-07-03T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Digging into Vinny's secret online game, Pedro and Pritam uncover a digital maze. A subtle discovery rattles the family, as Pritam's past creeps closer than he expects.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/p7OlHqgZXFHt7H5WTyzFkljVg1Q.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyNi9Qcml0YW0lMjBhbmQlMjBQZWRybyUyMCUyODIwMjYlMjkv.1.5","title":"Catch Me If You Can","season":1,"episode":5,"released":"2026-07-03T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Pedro wants to catch a criminal, but Pritam wants to track a mind. The hunt flips, turning the case into a cat-and-mouse game where Pedro isn't sure who is chasing whom.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9JORxZPkMoHJDtjVUTW5YsilC9h.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyNi9Qcml0YW0lMjBhbmQlMjBQZWRybyUyMCUyODIwMjYlMjkv.1.6","title":"The Trap","season":1,"episode":6,"released":"2026-07-03T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Time's up! Is Martin really their guy? Pritam, Pedro and the entire police squad better act quick… before Vinny loses his life.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vKleSrov3Qnozav6n7eMDAf6pTs.jpg"}]}}